1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Forty-Sixth Episode
The Butterfly Witch

15
00:01:56,021 --> 00:01:59,331
At this pace, it won't take
long to get to Goldland!

16
00:01:59,381 --> 00:02:01,576
Soon we'll be in sight
of my castle!

17
00:02:02,421 --> 00:02:04,013
Good, Franco!

18
00:02:10,781 --> 00:02:14,615
Good heavens! Did you see,
Franco? There's a fire in the city!

19
00:02:15,021 --> 00:02:17,012
I wonder what could have happened..!

20
00:02:17,061 --> 00:02:20,019
I must go and see immediately.
I hope it's not serious.

21
00:02:20,061 --> 00:02:23,497
There will be chaos in the city, so you
go to the castle and wait for me there.

22
00:02:24,741 --> 00:02:28,256
But Franco, if I came with you, I
could be of help to you, don't you think?

23
00:02:28,301 --> 00:02:31,850
Don't worry, I alone will be enough
to organize the firefighting efforts.

24
00:02:32,741 --> 00:02:35,539
And don't follow me!
Understood? See you later! Bye!

25
00:02:37,061 --> 00:02:40,292
I'd really like to help
him, but he won't let me.

26
00:02:40,741 --> 00:02:42,732
And yet I must find a way.

27
00:02:44,141 --> 00:02:47,895
I have an idea! I'll follow
him, but in another guise!

28
00:02:53,501 --> 00:02:56,095
Take a look around,
Opal! Do you see anyone?

29
00:02:56,501 --> 00:02:58,093
Good!

30
00:03:00,221 --> 00:03:02,735
- Help!
- Fire!

31
00:03:02,781 --> 00:03:05,693
- There's a fire!
- It's horrible!

32
00:03:06,061 --> 00:03:10,532
- Quick, let's run away!
- Help! Let's run away!

33
00:03:11,221 --> 00:03:14,531
- Water! Throw the water!
- Water! Help!

34
00:03:14,941 --> 00:03:18,297
- Quick! Quick!
- Fast! Fast! Fast! Fast!

35
00:03:22,581 --> 00:03:24,811
The fire will spread
through the whole city!

36
00:03:24,861 --> 00:03:28,012
Let's run! The mysterious
knight has set a fire!

37
00:03:28,061 --> 00:03:30,052
It was really him!

38
00:03:30,541 --> 00:03:33,101
- I saw him too!
- Oh, yes!

39
00:03:33,261 --> 00:03:36,059
- He himself!
- Yes, he set the fire!

40
00:03:36,101 --> 00:03:38,092
- Yes, really him!
- What?! The mysterious knight...

41
00:03:38,141 --> 00:03:40,496
...set the fire?
- They say it was him!

42
00:03:40,541 --> 00:03:43,533
It's incredible!
You can't believe it!

43
00:03:47,901 --> 00:03:50,654
How could such a big
fire have been possible?

44
00:03:50,821 --> 00:03:53,574
Prince Franco, they saw
the mysterious knight...

45
00:03:53,621 --> 00:03:56,260
...setting the fire!
- The mysterious knight?!

46
00:03:56,301 --> 00:03:58,292
But it's not possible!

47
00:04:03,861 --> 00:04:07,410
Let's run, before everything
collapses! Save yourselves!

48
00:04:13,741 --> 00:04:18,019
We must contain the flames! Let's
run, before everything collapses!

49
00:04:18,261 --> 00:04:21,014
Prince Franco! Let's run!

50
00:04:22,141 --> 00:04:24,132
It's the mysterious knight!

51
00:04:24,181 --> 00:04:26,376
Wait, mysterious knight!

52
00:04:26,421 --> 00:04:28,412
I must follow him
even through the fire!

53
00:04:28,541 --> 00:04:31,419
- Help!
- Who is it?

54
00:04:31,541 --> 00:04:35,693
- Help! Help!
- It's a little girl!

55
00:04:39,501 --> 00:04:42,334
You're safe, dear! Don't
worry, everything is fine.

56
00:04:42,381 --> 00:04:44,099
Mysterious knight!

57
00:04:44,141 --> 00:04:47,019
How dare you return to the
scene of your wicked deed?

58
00:04:47,061 --> 00:04:49,017
- What do you mean?
- Are you playing dumb?

59
00:04:49,061 --> 00:04:51,052
We know that you set the fire!

60
00:04:51,101 --> 00:04:53,899
- What? I set the fire?! But that's a lie!

61
00:04:53,941 --> 00:04:56,296
- Damn it, stop pretending!

62
00:04:58,341 --> 00:05:00,457
- One moment! There
must be a misunderstanding!

63
00:05:00,501 --> 00:05:02,492
- This is no time to argue.

64
00:05:02,541 --> 00:05:05,692
In the meantime, I am arresting you, and then
you can clear your name before the judges!

65
00:05:05,821 --> 00:05:09,894
- Wait! First of all, we must
get this little girl to safety...

66
00:05:09,941 --> 00:05:12,216
- Enough talk! Get off your horse!

67
00:05:18,021 --> 00:05:20,296
- Let's put our differences aside for now!

68
00:05:20,341 --> 00:05:22,252
Right now we need to save
ourselves, we're in danger!

69
00:05:22,301 --> 00:05:24,019
- Fine, as you wish.

70
00:05:24,661 --> 00:05:27,414
We must get this little girl
out of here immediately.

71
00:05:27,541 --> 00:05:30,817
- Yes, I'll take care of her. Poor
thing, she fainted from the shock.

72
00:05:30,861 --> 00:05:33,659
- Prince Franco, we will
discuss the matter later!

73
00:05:36,381 --> 00:05:38,019
- Scoundrel!

74
00:06:00,421 --> 00:06:04,892
- I hear noises in the chimney...

75
00:06:05,341 --> 00:06:09,653
Maybe it's my little ones.
- Well, well! I see my dear little girls have come home!

76
00:06:12,301 --> 00:06:15,452
- Yes, I want to reward
you with the best food.

77
00:06:15,740 --> 00:06:18,096
- Come! Come, dears!

78
00:06:18,140 --> 00:06:22,532
There's honey soup! Eat!
- Go ahead and eat, my little ones!

79
00:06:23,460 --> 00:06:25,213
- Who's there?

80
00:06:25,780 --> 00:06:29,535
The mysterious knight who
set fire to the city of Goldland!

81
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:32,175
Shut your mouths, you fools!

82
00:06:32,220 --> 00:06:34,530
If they find out
what I made you do,

83
00:06:34,580 --> 00:06:37,732
I'll turn you into bats!
Is that clear?

84
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:41,297
But you were the one who told us
to shout from the rooftops that...

85
00:06:41,340 --> 00:06:43,935
..The mysterious knight
set the fire!

86
00:06:44,260 --> 00:06:48,300
You were supposed to shout that in the city,
but here you speak in low voices!

87
00:06:48,620 --> 00:06:51,454
- Go on, speak!
- Everything went very well,

88
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:55,380
- we set the fire.
- Why are you speaking in low voices?!

89
00:06:55,420 --> 00:06:58,015
But you told us
to speak in low voices!

90
00:06:58,060 --> 00:07:00,495
That's not it, you damned idiots!

91
00:07:00,660 --> 00:07:02,891
Franco is convinced that it was
the mysterious knight...

92
00:07:02,940 --> 00:07:04,852
..who set the fire?

93
00:07:04,900 --> 00:07:06,414
Yes!

94
00:07:06,460 --> 00:07:09,020
Now you can even give us
something to eat as a reward!

95
00:07:09,060 --> 00:07:11,097
- We've gotten hungry!
- First make sure...

96
00:07:11,140 --> 00:07:13,291
...that the plan is going
perfectly smoothly.

97
00:07:13,340 --> 00:07:16,139
- Then I'm not doing this anymore!
- And I hate these clothes!

98
00:07:18,220 --> 00:07:22,817
If you don't obey me, I'll throw
my butterfly food all over you!

99
00:07:26,060 --> 00:07:29,940
You wouldn't like it if my friends
found you tasty, would you?

100
00:07:29,980 --> 00:07:32,176
No, definitely not! I beg you!

101
00:07:32,220 --> 00:07:34,416
We will do everything you ask us to do!

102
00:07:34,460 --> 00:07:37,897
- But don't let the butterflies eat us!
- Please! I beg you!

103
00:07:37,940 --> 00:07:41,934
Fine! Then I will send
you to the dream world!

104
00:07:47,020 --> 00:07:50,900
There, go into the wonderful dream world!

105
00:07:51,820 --> 00:07:56,212
Look at the magic sphere! It will
give you strength and courage!

106
00:07:56,260 --> 00:07:59,014
Listen now to what I command you to do!

107
00:07:59,060 --> 00:08:01,416
You will go to the castle of Goldland...

108
00:08:01,460 --> 00:08:05,215
and you will take the Prince's sword,
which is in Franco's room,

109
00:08:05,260 --> 00:08:08,458
to stir up his hatred!

110
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:13,657
Come on! Get a move on
and get moving, you slackers!

111
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:15,898
At your orders!

112
00:08:36,220 --> 00:08:38,098
Franco has created a misunderstanding.

113
00:08:38,140 --> 00:08:40,416
It's best that I clarify
things, somehow.

114
00:09:02,821 --> 00:09:06,131
- The sword case! There it is!
- Shut up!

115
00:09:10,421 --> 00:09:12,730
Didn't you see that nearby
there's a guard? Idiot!

116
00:09:12,781 --> 00:09:15,420
We must act with the utmost
caution! Let's go!

117
00:09:22,261 --> 00:09:24,821
Damn it!
But this is just a suit of armor!

118
00:09:26,541 --> 00:09:28,020
Who goes there?

119
00:09:28,061 --> 00:09:30,529
I think I heard a noise
coming from the room.

120
00:09:30,581 --> 00:09:31,855
Right!

121
00:09:34,821 --> 00:09:37,335
No, it's just a cat and a mouse.

122
00:09:37,381 --> 00:09:39,099
Right!

123
00:09:42,581 --> 00:09:45,891
If we take this to the witch,
she will be very grateful to us.

124
00:09:45,941 --> 00:09:48,455
Yes, this time she'll feed us!

125
00:10:10,101 --> 00:10:12,012
Good heavens!

126
00:10:17,261 --> 00:10:19,297
The Prince's sword is gone!

127
00:10:20,741 --> 00:10:24,211
"I'm taking this sword!
Signed: the mysterious knight"

128
00:10:24,621 --> 00:10:26,612
Damnation!

129
00:10:26,661 --> 00:10:29,459
You're a thief and a coward,
mysterious knight!

130
00:10:29,501 --> 00:10:31,332
But it doesn't end here!

131
00:10:32,421 --> 00:10:35,094
- Who is it?
- It's me, Franco! It's Zaffiro!

132
00:10:36,741 --> 00:10:38,811
You came to the castle, Zaffiro?!

133
00:10:41,261 --> 00:10:43,092
Yes! Hi, Franco!

134
00:10:43,141 --> 00:10:45,336
Zaffiro, I told you not to come!

135
00:10:45,381 --> 00:10:48,100
But I was worried about you and the fire.

136
00:10:48,421 --> 00:10:50,935
- What happened?
- It’s hard to believe!

137
00:10:50,981 --> 00:10:53,734
That cursed ghost knight set fire to the city,

138
00:10:53,781 --> 00:10:56,056
putting the lives of its inhabitants in danger.

139
00:10:56,101 --> 00:10:59,173
Not content with that, he stole the Prince's famous sword!

140
00:10:59,901 --> 00:11:02,017
It couldn't have been him!

141
00:11:02,421 --> 00:11:05,697
You don't believe it, huh? At first
I didn't want to believe it either,

142
00:11:05,741 --> 00:11:08,414
but then I saw him with my own eyes
running through the city.

143
00:11:08,461 --> 00:11:10,736
I have clear proof here:
this note!

144
00:11:10,781 --> 00:11:12,578
- Read it!
- What?!

145
00:11:12,821 --> 00:11:15,893
It's strange...! Who could have
ever done such a thing?

146
00:11:16,301 --> 00:11:19,737
Now you won't keep believing
that it wasn't him, I hope!

147
00:11:20,101 --> 00:11:23,013
No, I think it could be
a plan organized by...

148
00:11:23,061 --> 00:11:26,770
You really are very naive. Shut up,
I'll take care of this matter.

149
00:11:27,061 --> 00:11:29,450
- But Franco..!
- I don't want to hear anything

150
00:11:30,421 --> 00:11:32,093
Go home!

151
00:11:34,501 --> 00:11:37,015
- Please, go home!
- As you wish.

152
00:11:37,621 --> 00:11:40,533
Franco, we'll see each other again
when you've cleared your head.

153
00:11:41,261 --> 00:11:42,899
Bye!

154
00:11:54,021 --> 00:11:57,252
Maybe I made him angry,
but I didn't mean to.

155
00:11:58,501 --> 00:12:00,731
I'm sorry, Franco.
I'm sorry.

156
00:12:09,021 --> 00:12:11,899
The Princess is approaching.

157
00:12:11,941 --> 00:12:14,136
She won't be able to save herself!

158
00:12:29,021 --> 00:12:31,012
Run, Opale! Get away!

159
00:12:40,821 --> 00:12:44,177
Damnation! That bitch
is killing my little creatures!

160
00:12:44,221 --> 00:12:47,099
I must stop her
and teach her a good lesson!

161
00:12:47,141 --> 00:12:49,336
Go into the world of dreams!

162
00:12:52,141 --> 00:12:53,938
That light...!

163
00:12:54,261 --> 00:13:01,133
You sleep such a strange sleep
that it can no longer be called human!

164
00:13:05,021 --> 00:13:07,012
My head is spinning!

165
00:13:27,141 --> 00:13:30,816
Zaffiro, I'm sorry for how
I behaved the other night.

166
00:13:35,581 --> 00:13:37,776
An arrow! With a letter!

167
00:13:38,341 --> 00:13:40,650
"I await you at the edge
of the forest for a challenge,

168
00:13:40,701 --> 00:13:43,773
today, at sunset.
Signed: the mysterious knight"

169
00:13:45,821 --> 00:13:48,415
You really are a brazen one,
mysterious knight!

170
00:13:55,861 --> 00:13:59,297
Where the hell am I?
What am I doing here?

171
00:14:10,221 --> 00:14:13,850
Yes, I've got it! This is the base
of the false mysterious knight!

172
00:14:14,741 --> 00:14:16,618
Someone is coming!

173
00:14:31,781 --> 00:14:35,535
- I'm starving!
- Finally we can eat.

174
00:14:35,581 --> 00:14:38,812
No, not yet!
Go to the swamp in the forest,

175
00:14:38,861 --> 00:14:41,329
and gather a basket
full of algae!

176
00:14:41,381 --> 00:14:43,736
Dammit!

177
00:14:45,181 --> 00:14:48,014
What is it?
What are you waiting for?

178
00:14:48,061 --> 00:14:51,610
- We're too hungry...
- To make even the slightest move!

179
00:14:51,941 --> 00:14:56,412
Then I'll stick some
of my butterfly mush on you!

180
00:14:56,461 --> 00:14:59,419
No! No! Forget it!
Let's go right away!

181
00:15:01,901 --> 00:15:06,019
Good, the Princess
is sleeping soundly

182
00:15:07,021 --> 00:15:10,252
Now she will wear the clothes
of the mysterious knight.

183
00:15:13,901 --> 00:15:16,813
The spell
wasn't strong enough!

184
00:15:17,221 --> 00:15:20,896
Did you send a fake mysterious knight
to set fire to the city?

185
00:15:22,101 --> 00:15:24,331
You guessed right!
But don't celebrate yet,

186
00:15:24,381 --> 00:15:27,339
because now I will get rid of you!
Take this!

187
00:15:41,581 --> 00:15:44,573
Good!
My trap worked!

188
00:15:44,621 --> 00:15:46,930
Tied up like this,
you won't be able to escape anymore!

189
00:15:46,981 --> 00:15:51,372
I’ll meet Franco in your
place, my dear masked knight!

190
00:15:51,541 --> 00:15:54,009
What?! No, wait!
Leave Franco alone!

191
00:15:54,061 --> 00:15:57,133
Now, my dear little creatures,
come and have fun with me!

192
00:15:57,181 --> 00:15:58,819
Follow me!

193
00:15:59,821 --> 00:16:02,893
Cursed witch!
She has another evil plan!

194
00:16:03,021 --> 00:16:05,615
I must try to warn
Franco immediately!

195
00:16:11,621 --> 00:16:14,818
Franco! Franco, watch out!

196
00:16:33,621 --> 00:16:36,419
I’ve been here for an hour
and no one is showing up.

197
00:16:36,661 --> 00:16:38,299
What a coward!

198
00:16:50,221 --> 00:16:54,055
Look, look at my light that
leads you through dreams!

199
00:16:56,101 --> 00:16:58,092
And who are you? What do you want?

200
00:16:58,181 --> 00:17:02,732
The mysterious knight will
not come here, Prince Franco.

201
00:17:02,781 --> 00:17:06,899
Now you will fall asleep
and go to him in a dream!

202
00:17:10,101 --> 00:17:12,012
My head is spinning..

203
00:17:12,061 --> 00:17:15,417
Gush from the depths of the earth,
evil fluid!

204
00:17:15,461 --> 00:17:18,931
Send sparks and flames
through the sky, fire!

205
00:17:18,981 --> 00:17:25,250
And you, my dear children, dance
and celebrate the end of the world!

206
00:17:39,701 --> 00:17:43,899
My handsome little Prince, I command you
to go to the mill, in the forest,

207
00:17:43,941 --> 00:17:46,330
and to kill
the mysterious knight!

208
00:17:49,701 --> 00:17:51,419
Yes, I will kill him!

209
00:17:54,461 --> 00:17:56,258
Damn it!

210
00:18:03,901 --> 00:18:06,131
You see that you cannot
escape that witch,

211
00:18:06,181 --> 00:18:08,172
no matter how hard you try?

212
00:18:08,221 --> 00:18:11,372
- She is a horrible
and terrible old woman! - How stupid!

213
00:18:11,541 --> 00:18:14,533
You two really are fools
to let yourselves be treated like dogs...

214
00:18:14,581 --> 00:18:16,617
...by an old witch
like that!

215
00:18:17,021 --> 00:18:20,218
Actually, we have tried
to escape many times!

216
00:18:20,261 --> 00:18:23,014
But every time she
cast a spell on us!

217
00:18:23,061 --> 00:18:26,531
Then let's join forces,
so we can destroy her!

218
00:18:26,581 --> 00:18:28,173
What?!

219
00:18:28,221 --> 00:18:30,815
If you untie me, when she arrives
I will try to kill her.

220
00:18:30,861 --> 00:18:32,852
While I fight her,
you can escape!

221
00:18:32,901 --> 00:18:34,698
So, what do you say? Are you in?

222
00:18:38,901 --> 00:18:42,132
- Of course I want to! I accept!
- I accept too!

223
00:18:42,341 --> 00:18:45,651
The witch is already back! Help!

224
00:18:46,741 --> 00:18:48,652
How unlucky I am...

225
00:18:53,181 --> 00:18:55,058
But that's Franco!

226
00:18:55,381 --> 00:18:58,020
Franco, the mysterious
knight is in front of you!

227
00:18:58,061 --> 00:19:01,497
Remember how much he made you
suffer! Come on, tear him to pieces!

228
00:19:04,341 --> 00:19:06,571
Damned mysterious knight!

229
00:19:08,581 --> 00:19:10,412
Franco, it's me!

230
00:19:14,421 --> 00:19:16,252
Damn it!

231
00:19:19,341 --> 00:19:21,571
Franco, I'm sorry! Are you okay?

232
00:19:25,861 --> 00:19:28,659
Zaffiro, why are you here? What
are you doing in front of me?

233
00:19:30,221 --> 00:19:32,815
Franco, a moment ago you tried to kill me.

234
00:19:33,021 --> 00:19:35,933
- What? Kill you?!
- It's her fault!

235
00:19:35,981 --> 00:19:38,620
She cast a spell on us
and made it so...

236
00:19:38,661 --> 00:19:41,414
...that a fake mysterious knight
would torment you too!

237
00:19:42,661 --> 00:19:46,051
- Take this!
- Franco, watch out!

238
00:19:47,301 --> 00:19:49,098
What is this?

239
00:19:58,021 --> 00:20:00,012
Ah, damn it!

240
00:20:02,821 --> 00:20:05,016
Wait, you ugly witch!

241
00:20:09,261 --> 00:20:11,013
He's not here!

242
00:20:35,221 --> 00:20:37,132
Look, the ceiling is lowering!

243
00:20:38,541 --> 00:20:41,453
Damn it, Franco!
The door won't open!

244
00:20:41,621 --> 00:20:44,215
That cursed woman
has put us in a trap!

245
00:20:50,461 --> 00:20:53,339
Now you know well
what happens to those who go..

246
00:20:53,381 --> 00:20:56,418
...against the famous witch of the
butterflies of Union X, huh?

247
00:20:57,501 --> 00:21:00,334
Damn! Another trap
from Union X!

248
00:21:02,221 --> 00:21:04,530
You're finished! Take that!

249
00:21:22,341 --> 00:21:25,174
Curse it!
Damn them!

250
00:21:25,221 --> 00:21:28,497
I'll let the ceiling fall
on them! I'll crush them like worms!

251
00:21:33,581 --> 00:21:35,617
- We have to get out! Quick!
- Yes!

252
00:21:43,381 --> 00:21:45,417
Quick, Franco!

253
00:21:45,701 --> 00:21:47,419
Zaffiro, there!

254
00:22:24,941 --> 00:22:28,013
I will never play
the fake mysterious knight again!

255
00:22:28,061 --> 00:22:30,052
- Me neither!
- And I, instead, was wrong..

256
00:22:30,101 --> 00:22:32,137
..not to believe the real one.

257
00:22:32,621 --> 00:22:35,818
Prince Franco,
we would like to return this to you

258
00:22:36,821 --> 00:22:40,416
Thank you, friends. I’m leaving it for you as
thank you for helping us.

259
00:22:40,901 --> 00:22:44,291
- What?! Such a beautiful sword?
- It’s not possible!

260
00:22:44,341 --> 00:22:46,013
Even though the witch is dead,

261
00:22:46,061 --> 00:22:48,416
another agent of Union X
could attack us,

262
00:22:48,461 --> 00:22:50,531
so keep that one
for safety!

263
00:22:50,581 --> 00:22:53,095
- You might also need it.
- Thank you, Prince!

264
00:22:53,261 --> 00:22:56,731
- I'm keeping it! He gave it to me!
- I stole it! It's mine! It's mine!

265
00:22:56,781 --> 00:22:58,419
No, this is mine!

266
00:22:58,461 --> 00:23:01,817
Stop fighting!
You must remain good friends.

267
00:23:02,701 --> 00:23:05,499
- Good friends...!
- But we love each other!

268
00:23:05,661 --> 00:23:08,619
Sapphire, from now on we will
fight together against the enemies.

269
00:23:08,661 --> 00:23:10,413
I couldn't ask for anything better.

270
00:23:45,061 --> 00:23:48,681
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

271
00:23:48,682 --> 00:23:52,042
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

272
00:23:52,043 --> 00:23:55,813
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

273
